  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to 'Paradiso Del Mare' professionally managed by Stay on 30A a seven-bedroom Inlet Beach coastal haven where effortless elegance meets vacation indulgence. Sleeping up to 18 guests, this stunning retreat features a main home and a charming pool house, offering the perfect balance of togetherness and privacy for large families and groups. Enjoy a private pool, relaxing hot tub, and breathtaking Gulf views. All just a short walk from the sugar-white sands and minutes from the vibrant energy of Rosemary Beach. Inside, you'll find open, sun-filled living spaces thoughtfully designed with refined coastal décor, high-end finishes, and a calming neutral palette. The fully stocked kitchen is a showpiece, featuring premium appliances, an oversized island, and every culinary tool needed for everything from casual breakfasts to celebratory dinners. The seamless flow between the kitchen, dining, and living areas makes gathering with loved ones effortless and memorable.<br><br>The separate pool house provides its own stylish living space, perfect for guests who want a little extra privacy while still being close to the action.<br><br>Start your mornings with coffee on the breezy balconies, where the sound of the waves and the salt-kissed air set the tone for the day. After beach adventures, boutique shopping in nearby Rosemary Beach, or an afternoon exploring the popular 30Avenue a lively destination for upscale dining, shopping, and entertainment. Unwind by the sparkling pool or soak in the hot tub as the sun dips below the horizon.<br><br>Located in the heart of Inlet Beach, Paradiso Del Mare puts you steps from beach access, minutes from award-winning restaurants and shops, and close to the best of 30A's coastal charm. For added ease, the home includes a golf cart and ten adult bikes, making it simple to explore the area or enjoy sunset rides along the coast.<br><br>With Gulf views, upscale comforts, and the rare bonus of a private pool house, Paradiso Del Mare isn't just a place to stay it's where your most unforgettable vacation memories will be made.<br><br>HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>-Gulf views<br>-.3 miles to the Gulf- Wall Street Public Access <br>-Private pool & Spa **Pool heating is available for this property for $80 per day**<br>-Spacious porches<br>-Bocci Ball<br>-Pool House<br>-Golf Cart (6-seater)<br>-Stand-alone ice maker<br>-Private gated courtyard<br>-10 adult bikes<br>-6 dedicated parking spots<br>-Elevator<br>-Outdoor shower<br>-Sunloungers<br>-Wrap around porch<br>-30Avenue<br>-Steps from Rosemary Beach<br><br>ACCOMMODATIONS:<br>Sleeps: 18<br><br>FIRST FLOOR (Ground Level):<br>Bedroom 1: King, Ensuite Bathroom<br>Bedroom 2: (3) Twin/Twin Bunks, Ensuite Bathroom<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>Bedroom 3: King, Ensuite Bathroom<br>Bedroom 4: King, Ensuite Bathroom <br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>Bedroom 5: King, Ensuite Bathroom<br>Bedroom 6: King, Ensuite Bathroom<br><br>POOL HOUSE:<br>Bedroom 7: King, Ensuite Bathroom<br><br>BEACH ACCESS<br>Two access points, just a short walk from the home:<br><br>1. Inlet Beach Public Access. This access has parking, restrooms, and lifeguards during peak season. Located at the end of South Orange Street about 200 yards south of US Hwy 98. Inlet Beach Regional Access is the largest county access and features three dune walkovers and 117 parking spaces.<br><br>2. Wall Street Beach Public Access. This access is at the end of South Wall Street. About 200 yards east of the intersection of Scenic 30A and Hwy 98, turn south on to South Wall Street then proceed two blocks to the dead end at the gulf. There is no parking but there is plenty of parking, along with restrooms and outdoor showers about 1/4 mile east at the Inlet Beach Access.<br><br>**WHAT WE OFFER**<br><br>A STARTER SUPPLY OF PREMIUM AMENITIES:<br>Body Wash | Shampoo | Conditioner | Hand Soap | Toilet Paper | Dish Soap | Dishwasher Pods | Laundry Detergent | Paper Towels | Trash Bags | Dish Sponge | Bath Towels | Bed Linens | Pool Towels<br><br>WELCOME BUNDLE: Coffee Grounds | Coffee Filters | 2 Keurig Pods | Popcorn | Olive Oil | Fiji Water<br><br>PARKING<br>Six parking spaces available (6 driveway). No street parking allowed.<br><br>Included is a 6 seater golf cart and 10 bicycles (adult) for your convenience. To drive golf cart, you must be: 25 years old, sign a liability waiver, and have valid insurance and drivers license. Golf Cart is included as an amenity, at no additional cost.<br><br>HOUSE RULES<br>*Check-In: After 4PM | Check-Out: Before 10AM<br>*Must be 25 years of age to book. Guests under 25 must be accompanied by a parent or guardian that is staying on premises.<br>*No Smoking: Smoking is strictly prohibited including back porch/deck. <br>*No parties or events.<br>*Complimentary golf cart can only be operated by guests over 25 years of age who provide verification. Rental agreement requires a valid drivers license and proof of existing auto insurance coverage. <br>*Elevator (Elevator usage is not available for guests unless it is needed by an elderly or handicapped individual. Please contact Stay on 30a prior to the arrival date for such arrangements. Elevator goes between first and second floor)<br>*During busier times and due to limited infrastructure, internet connectivity may be affected. No refunds will be given for connection issues no wifi, or slow wifi.<br>*Private Heated Pool With Spa **Pool heating is available for an additional fee of $25/day. Must be heated for duration of stay. If selected, it must be requested 48 hours prior to check in and paid before the heater will be turned on.<br>*The home must remain pet free to the rules.<br>*There are no refunds for weather related events. We advise trip insurance during hurricane season (May-November)​​​​​​​<br><br>IMPORTANT PRIOR TO ARRIVAL<br>All guests will be required to sign a rental agreement, as well as provide a valid ID that matches with the name of the person that made the reservation which includes: 1) a photo of your government issued ID such as a driver's license and 2) a \"selfie\". Both should be uploaded to our Happy Stays app.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
